---
import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---
<ResearchLayout title="P8｜Future Watch｜J 的世界 Research" page="P8" section="FUTURE WATCH">
<div class="poster">
 <div class="poster-inner">
  <div class="poster-top"><div class="poster-kicker">P7 · FUTURE WATCH</div><div class="poster-title">下一個真正值得驗證的訊號</div><div class="poster-sub">不是猜哪一天發生，而是觀察證據何時變強。</div></div>
  <div class="timeline">
   <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div class="timeline-year">01 · VALIDATION</div><h3>驗證</h3><p>技術是否從展示走進實際測試？</p></div>
   <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div class="timeline-year">02 · ADOPTION</div><h3>導入</h3><p>是否進入產品設計、製程與供應鏈？</p></div>
   <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div class="timeline-year">03 · PRODUCTION</div><h3>量產</h3><p>良率、產能與成本是否開始成立？</p></div>
   <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot"></div><div class="timeline-year">04 · DIFFUSION</div><h3>擴散</h3><p>是否從單點案例變成產業趨勢？</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="poster-panel" style="margin-top:26px;position:relative;z-index:2"><div class="poster-kicker">FUTURE WATCH</div><p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:1rem;color:#35465a">當證據從「驗證」一路走到「擴散」，我們對產業趨勢的理解才會逐步提高。這也是後續研究最重要的追蹤框架。</p></div>
  <div class="poster-footer"><strong>FUTURE WATCH</strong><span>Validation → Adoption → Production → Diffusion</span><span>P7</span></div>
 </div>
</div>
<div class="note"><strong>J 的觀察</strong>真正有價值的訊號，往往不是新聞出現的那一天，而是證據開始連續出現、彼此互相驗證的時候。</div>
</ResearchLayout>
